# Human Priest 1 / Mage 1 holding Protection from Evil from BOTH sources, carrying Mystic Aegis (bd inc-4999).
# Same character as chargen-human-priest-mage-save.keys; after Mage 1 it conjures the book (wizard Item
# Acquisition), marks both Protection from Evil rows in Learn Spell (Call Companions unmarked to free
# a level-1 slot), descends to depth 2 + genocides (rest needs both), takes one full rest, and saves.
# The level-1 table sorts by source (Arcane, then Divine), then by name, so Prot.
# from Evil (Arcane) is row 6, Call Companions (Divine) row 12, and Prot. from
# Evil (Divine) row 25.
a       # Initial Choices: [a] Create a New Character
n       # Alter the character generation options? -- no
y       # Your options will place the game in Explore Mode. Continue? -- yes
@choose "Human"
@choose "Poison Use"
@choose "Spot"
@choose "Priest"
@choose "Aiswin"        # God, asked here rather than after the skill ranks,
c                       # Attributes: the third of the five offered sets. The
@choose "Lawful Good"   # Alignment. The god decides which are on offer.
a                       # First feat. Which feats the game offers depends on
@while "Choose a Domain" a
@while "|  *" RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT DOWN
ENTER y # Done, and confirm keeping the ranks
y       # Do you wish to worship <god>? -- yes
@while "Choose a Domain" a
@while "|  *" RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT DOWN
ENTER y
a a
@while "Choose a Domain" a
@while "|  *" RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT DOWN
ENTER y
a       # Personality archetype
@expect "Learn Spells: Level"    # the starting-spells checklist
SPACE DOWN SPACE DOWN SPACE DOWN SPACE DOWN    # mark the first rows; a full level refuses the rest
SPACE DOWN SPACE DOWN SPACE DOWN SPACE DOWN
ENTER
@dump:chargen-done
@while "personality archetype" a
@until "System Menu" ESC
@expect "System Menu"
